  "path_redaction": "Only the absolute workspace prefix in delivery-rules.log changed, in 1 field, to <fixture-workspace>. Its source and export hashes are distinct. The trace is published as recorded: its program_artifacts section names the four program binaries by their absolute paths on the machine that ran it.",
  "link_rewrite": "The delivery-rules program's README.md links to its record as ../../../../docs/evidence/delivery-rules-20261118/README.md in the Account repository. Here that one link reads ../../../../../README.md, this record's guide, so its source and export hashes are distinct. No other byte changed. Every file other than delivery-rules.log and README.md is byte-identical to its source commit.",
  "source_files": "The seven build inputs under source/foundation/onchain/ whose hashes are not already published are copied byte for byte at the program_source commit, and their SHA-256 values equal the entries for the same paths in the trace's build_inputs. One other build input is identical to a file under ../early-settlement/source/, three to files under ../pinned-price/source/, one to a file under ../pinned-delivery/source/ and the remaining 59 to files under ../source/. The base commit's program source is the program source of the early-settlement record. The retained binary and the README of the delivery-rules program are not build inputs: the binary is the file the run loaded, copied at the program_source commit, and the README is the copy on the Account repository's main branch. The files retain their existing copyright, and this release adds no license grant for them."
